# Mutation plan for the five OAuth app writes.
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/oauth-app-writes.plan
#
# What is worth mutating:
#
#   * the five fields copied off the old app, of which **ClientSecret** is the one that makes
#     `regen_secret` a separate route;
#   * `is_public`, which is stored nowhere and survives only as an empty secret;
#   * the two "silently clear/preserve rather than refuse" branches on `is_trusted`;
#   * the DCR endpoint, whose failures are a **different envelope** from every other route here;
#   * the delete cascade, whose statement order decides whether sessions survive.
#
# The last two lines are the no-op controls and must SURVIVE.
oauth-create-answers-200	crates/mm-api/src/oauth.rs	        Ok(saved) => encoded_json(StatusCode::CREATED, &saved),	        Ok(saved) => encoded_json(StatusCode::OK, &saved),	api	oauth_app_writes
